flowchart TD
    A[Open camera capture prompt] --> B(User snaps photo of artwork)
    B --> C[Upload image to backend storage]
    C --> D(Call Google Cloud Vision API)
    D --> E{Did Vision API recognize artwork?}
    E -->|No| F{Pop-up dialog selection}
    F -->|Retake| A
    F -->|Continue| G[Enter title and artist manually]
    E -->|Yes| H[Extract artwork title and artist]
    H --> I(Query Wikipedia REST API)
    G --> I
    I --> J{Was Wikipedia article found?}
    J -->|No| K[Notice: No Wikipedia summary found]
    K --> L[Generate generic reflection questions]
    J -->|Yes| M[Parse historical summary and details]
    M --> N[Generate fact-grounded writing prompts via LLM]
    N --> O[Writing prompts ready]
    L --> O
    O --> P(Mint random owner secret and hash)
    P --> Q[Create item and entry records in database]
    Q --> R[Lock tag status to active with item ID and owner hash]
    R --> S[Return owner secret and hydrated payload to device]
    S --> T[Store owner secret in local storage]
    T --> U[Mount editable journaling canvas]
